                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33fa1858-c2c3-4017-84f1-dbf107f0c0d4",
                                "sense_id": "1d577b19-5cd3-3ea4-b52d-b6e2b2398419",
                                "text": "— Ну, э́то вы из друго́й о́перы хвати́ли, — бесцеремо́нно сказа́л Авинови́цкий. — «Ко́локол» Ге́рцен издава́л, а не Мицке́вич.\n— То друго́й «Ко́локол», — сказа́л Передо́нов, — Мицке́вич то́же издава́л «Ко́локол».",
                                "translation": "\" Well, you've caught that from another opera,\" said Avinovitsky unceremoniously. \" Herzen published it and not Mickiewicz.\"\n\" That was another ' Kolokol,' \" said Peredonov. \" Mickiewicz also published a ' Kolokol.' \"",
                                "english": "\" Well, you've caught that from another opera,\" said Avinovitsky unceremoniously. \" Herzen published it and not Mickiewicz.\"\n\" That was another ' Kolokol,' \" said Peredonov. \" Mickiewicz also published a ' Kolokol.' \""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
